WEBVTT

00:06:29.149 --> 00:06:34.616
(Applause)

00:06:37.249 --> 00:06:41.105
CA: Bill, this is your graph. What's this about?

00:06:41.105 --> 00:06:43.090
BG: Well, my graph has numbers on it.

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:45.208
(Laughter)

00:06:45.208 --> 00:06:47.025
I really like this graph.

00:06:47.025 --> 00:06:50.000
This is the number of children

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:52.562
who die before the age of five every year.

00:06:52.582 --> 00:06:54.405
And what you find is really

00:06:54.405 --> 00:06:56.355
a phenomenal success story

00:06:56.355 --> 00:06:58.509
which is not widely known,

00:06:58.509 --> 00:07:01.184
that we are making incredible progress.